                "entry_id": "2f7925a7-7e5f-347a-b641-d41bcc8731fd",
                "word": "Palmyrena",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "486eec12-74d7-3493-acb2-6f58921f6855",
                        "entry_id": "2f7925a7-7e5f-347a-b641-d41bcc8731fd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A historical region and country of the Syrian steppe, of which Palmyra was the capital."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2b9e4f5-e07d-44a7-9642-acf5850410e0",
                                "sense_id": "486eec12-74d7-3493-acb2-6f58921f6855",
                                "text": "[...] Taking his Journey through the dangerous and barren Desarts of Palmyrena ; [...]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0712675d-7571-43db-9033-b34bfce1611e",
                                "sense_id": "486eec12-74d7-3493-acb2-6f58921f6855",
                                "text": "[...] and then visited all the Borders of his Dominions; from Palmyrena in the North [...]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3d42d67c-a8b4-4710-96c7-c230bb30d741",
                                "sense_id": "486eec12-74d7-3493-acb2-6f58921f6855",
                                "text": "Southward from Palmyrena stretches a vast expanse of desert, the true home of the nomad from the earliest times, a land that has never been suited to cultivation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "71bd2a17-4ad4-4bca-969f-fba04bc92f4f",
                                "sense_id": "486eec12-74d7-3493-acb2-6f58921f6855",
                                "text": "By studying the Antonine Itinerary we get a fairly good idea of the northern and western borders of Palmyrena, [...]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "86b2d3ff-e3f0-4d7b-a594-b0126d362c17",
                                "sense_id": "486eec12-74d7-3493-acb2-6f58921f6855",
                                "text": "One originates from Khirbet Abu Duhur in the north-western Palmyrena."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "67133855-c77e-42fc-8be5-ff5a585500f0",
                                "sense_id": "486eec12-74d7-3493-acb2-6f58921f6855",
                                "text": "Trans-Jordan, the Palmyrena and the Euphrates valley were brought within the administered area ; [...]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f409bbc7-653d-49da-809e-c57f7ab487bd",
                                "sense_id": "486eec12-74d7-3493-acb2-6f58921f6855",
                                "text": "The most frequently used part of the Syrian Desert is Palmyrena."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
